{"id":"d7a16fc445b65679","group":"58","path":"58/batch05/58-df-zfc-order11-adjoint-pair.md","title":"ZFC Order11 Adjoint Pair","display":"df-zfc-order11-adjoint-pair — ZFC Order11 Adjoint Pair","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-order11-adjoint-pair","aliases":["58-df-zfc-order11-adjoint-pair"],"display":"df-zfc-order11-adjoint-pair — ZFC Order11 Adjoint Pair","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","[[../batch15/58-df-zfc-partial-order.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-order11-adjoint-pair"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-order11-adjoint-pair</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-order11-adjoint-pair — ZFC Order11 Adjoint Pair"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"9ee45afab4c00dd5\" href=\"?note=9ee45afab4c00dd5\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-zfc-partial-order.md\">../batch15/58-df-zfc-partial-order.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P,\\leq_P,Q,\\leq_Q,L,R\\in V\">\\(P,\\leq_P,Q,\\leq_Q,L,R\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PartialOrder}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{PartialOrder}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcOrder11AdjointPair}_S:V^6\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcOrder11AdjointPair}_S:V^6\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order11\\text{-}adjoint\\text{-}pair}\\vdash\\mathrm{ZfcOrder11AdjointPair}_S(L,R,P,\\leq_P,Q,\\leq_Q)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{PartialOrder}_S(P,\\leq_P)\\land\\mathrm{PartialOrder}_S(Q,\\leq_Q)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(L,P,Q)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(R,Q,P)\\land\\forall p\\in P\\;\\forall q\\in Q\\;(L(p)\\leq_Q q\\leftrightarrow p\\leq_P R(q))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order11\\text{-}adjoint\\text{-}pair}\\vdash\\mathrm{ZfcOrder11AdjointPair}_S(L,R,P,\\leq_P,Q,\\leq_Q)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{PartialOrder}_S(P,\\leq_P)\\land\\mathrm{PartialOrder}_S(Q,\\leq_Q)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(L,P,Q)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(R,Q,P)\\land\\forall p\\in P\\;\\forall q\\in Q\\;(L(p)\\leq_Q q\\leftrightarrow p\\leq_P R(q))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The two order relations and both function types are explicit.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-zfc-partial-order